Reason for fork and rename
--------------------------
This fork introduces substantial changes to the original project, including
a complete WYSIWYG editing mode (based on Milkdown/ProseMirror), custom
syntax node plugins, image resize/alignment, interactive table of contents,
and numerous other features. The scope of modifications diverges significantly
from the upstream project. To avoid imposing maintenance burden on the
upstream maintainers and to prevent confusion or compatibility issues for
users of the original cherry-markdown package, this derivative work is
published and maintained independently under a new name.

This is NOT an official Tencent product. The names "Tencent" and
"CherryMarkdown" are trademarks of their respective owners and are used
here solely to describe the origin of this work, as permitted by
Section 6 of the Apache License 2.0.

Modifications
--------------------------
All files in the src/wysiwyg/ directory are new additions.
All files in the src/addons/cherry-wysiwyg-milkdown-plugin.js,
src/WysiwygEditor.js, src/toolbars/hooks/SwitchWysiwyg.js,
src/toolbars/hooks/Footnote.js, and src/index.wysiwyg.js are new additions.
Many existing files have been modified to support the WYSIWYG mode.
For a complete list of changes, see the git history of this repository.

